3.1 Preparatory Activities
Before the arrival of the chicks, several preparations were undertaken to ensure the poultry house provided a suitable environment.
These activities included:
•	Cleaning the poultry house.
•	Repairing damaged wire mesh and doors.
•	Disinfecting the poultry house.
•	Installing feeders and drinkers.
•	Preparing the brooder section.
•	Spreading clean wood shavings.
•	Installing charcoal brooders/heat source.
•	Installing curtains to minimize cold stress.
•	Preparing record books.
•	Procuring feeds and vaccines.
